      "survival": 0.04
    },
    {
      "id": "f0473df1e-0",
      "kind": "gotcha",
      "text": "The problem is that Regex::new interprets hex escaped byte sequences as *Unicode codepoints* by default, but we want them to actually stand for their raw byte values.",
      "files": [
        "grep/src/literals.rs",
        "grep/src/search.rs",
        "tests/tests.rs"
      ],
      "commit": "0473df1ef5721143941fb7f883e22b17292b35bb",
      "split": "tune",
      "state": "stale",
      "survival": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "f160f0489-0",
      "kind": "decision",
      "text": "Instead of `Ok(n) if n == 0` we can just write `Ok(0)`.",
      "files": [
        "src/main.rs"
      ],
      "commit": "160f04894fea3fe47d1ce6231102aa52085bb4ef",
      "split": "holdout",
      "state": "unknown",
      "survival": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "fbb70f967-0",
      "kind": "decision",
      "text": "Instead of creating a particular atomic once and cloning it, we created a new value for each worker.",
      "files": [
        "ignore/src/walk.rs",
        "tests/tests.rs"
      ],
      "commit": "bb70f967437279e49fb87df23ae567c276e4cc33",
      "split": "holdout",
      "state": "stale",
      "survival": 0.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fde5cb7d2-0",
      "kind": "gotcha",
      "text": "The reason why the ^C handling was removed is because it is irrevocably broken on Windows and is impossible to do correctly and efficiently in ANSI terminals.",
      "files": [
        "src/args.rs",
        "src/main.rs"
      ],
      "commit": "de5cb7d22e00c18dfce082a68b0cf45924b56e7f",
      "split": "tune",
      "state": "stale",
      "survival": 0.06
    },
    {
      "id": "fde5cb7d2-1",
      "kind": "decision",
      "text": "This means that ripgrep will no longer try to reset your colors in your terminal if you kill it while searching.",
      "files": [
        "src/args.rs",
        "src/main.rs"
      ],
      "commit": "de5cb7d22e00c18dfce082a68b0cf45924b56e7f",
      "split": "tune",
      "state": "stale",
      "survival": 0.06
    },
    {
      "id": "fb187c1a8-0",
      "kind": "decision",
      "text": "There is no longer any \"smart\" handling of the 'bold' style.",
      "files": [
        "doc/rg.1",
        "src/app.rs",
        "src/args.rs",
        "src/printer.rs",
